00:46:33.186 --> 00:46:37.160
you can send them a LinkedIn mail on
the LinkedIn account and they'll get it.

00:46:37.160 --> 00:46:40.610
It's the best way to reach somebody
that you don't know how to reach.

00:46:40.610 --> 00:46:43.191
And so just sort of tuck that away,

00:46:43.191 --> 00:46:48.050
you can do that I think on the basic
free LinkedIn subscription.

00:46:48.050 --> 00:46:50.232
So many amounts of people here
probably know better than I.

00:46:50.232 --> 00:46:54.189
