Don't rush in and
take the potential risk or

00:52:07.199 --> 00:52:12.554
the potential war not just compensation,
but also roll the seat you mentioned.

00:52:12.554 --> 00:52:19.828
I'm trying to think how is really your
opinion, failure perceived because.

00:52:19.828 --> 00:52:21.880
&gt;&gt; Yeah, it depends.

00:52:21.880 --> 00:52:27.924
It's perceived differently,
depending on who's perceiving.

00:52:27.924 --> 00:52:32.499
As I said, you graduate from here
