00:52:46.199 --> 00:52:47.961
but then probably not.

00:52:47.961 --> 00:52:52.748
The other comment I would make is
career transitions that I've watched

00:52:52.748 --> 00:52:57.215
are historically quite easy from
large companies to small ones and

00:52:57.215 --> 00:53:00.023
quite hard from small ones to large ones.

00:53:00.023 --> 00:53:04.839
And so if you are going to go from
a big company background into

00:53:04.839 --> 00:53:09.756
an odd entrepreneurial world
think long and hard about that

00:53:09.756 --> 00:53:14.787
because it won't be that easy
to go back where you came from.

00:53:14.787 --> 00:53:19.006
I mean, maybe if it's a year or
