00:53:52.065 --> 00:53:55.590
the bigger, more mature companies and
it's just a fact of life.

00:53:55.590 --> 00:53:59.320
I think many of you have
probably experienced that.

00:53:59.320 --> 00:54:05.239
So, I think the likelihood is if you
are committing to an entrepreneurial

00:54:05.239 --> 00:54:09.545
