in which case they're
already interested in you.

00:54:34.410 --> 00:54:36.946
So you don't have to
they found you somehow,

00:54:36.946 --> 00:54:41.431
otherwise you didn't get in the door and
you weren't sitting in front of them.

00:54:41.431 --> 00:54:47.713
So that's a positive interview, if you got
it, and then all you have to do I mean,

00:54:47.713 --> 00:54:53.016
