01:00:56.190 --> 01:00:59.776
And here, this is where if you've
worked for really strong mentors and

01:00:59.776 --> 01:01:03.838
strong performers, they know about you,
If you stay in touch with them as even if

01:01:03.838 --> 01:01:07.162
they've moved on from where you are,
they'll think about you.

01:01:07.162 --> 01:01:08.336
They'll recommend you.

01:01:08.336 --> 01:01:11.687
because they're the people with
the reputations who are going to get

01:01:11.687 --> 01:01:12.580
